{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades using one shared discount and tax calculation. Percentage discounts round half-up to the nearest cent. Fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal. Orders record the applied code and actual discount.\n\nUnknown, stacked, expired, and below-minimum promos raise `ValidationError` before billing state changes. Expiry dates are inclusive. Upgrade retries return the original entry when all arguments match, and changing `promo_code` or `as_of` raises an idempotency conflict.\n\nAdded five promo tests. `run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 15 tests passing."}}
